# ONNX Model Directory

This directory is reserved for the embedding model files used by RAGDroid.

## Expected Model: all-MiniLM-L6-v2

The app uses the `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` ONNX model for generating 384-dimensional embeddings.

### Option 1: Bundle in APK (increases APK size by ~80MB)
Place the following files here:
- `model.onnx` — the ONNX model file
- `tokenizer.json` — the tokenizer configuration

### Option 2: Download on First Launch (recommended)
Leave this directory empty. The `ModelManager` will download the model from a CDN
or GitHub release on the app's first launch and cache it in the app's files directory.

See `data/embedding/ModelManager.kt` for the download logic.

---

**Model Source:**
https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2

**ONNX Export:**
Use `optimum-cli` or Hugging Face's ONNX export tools to convert the PyTorch model.
